= January 1921

[? if vkpd_formed = 1 : In December the left wing of the Independents came over to us at the unification congress in Berlin. The party calls itself the United Communist Party, the **VKPD**, and it is no longer a sect. It has dozens of daily papers and the strongest positions in Halle-Merseburg, Thuringia and the Berlin factories. ?][? if vkpd_formed = 1 and levi_in_party = 1 : Paul Levi and Ernst Däumig share the chair. ?][? if vkpd_formed != 1 : The Independents did not split towards us. The party is still the **KPD**, and the left wing of the USPD still sits with Crispien and Hilferding. ?]

[? if kapp_outcome = 3 : Since the defeat of Kapp, Germany has had a government of the workers' parties and the unions. Nobody knows how long it can last. ?][? if kapp_outcome = 2 : The generals still rule from Berlin, and the party works half in the open and half underground. ?][? if luxemburg_alive = 1 : Rosa Luxemburg still writes the leading articles of the Rote Fahne. ?]

In Moscow, Zinoviev and Bukharin want the German party to act. [? if e21_levi_leads = 1 : Levi wants ?][? if e21_levi_leads = 0 : The cautious want ?] to win the majority of the working class first.
